# Trivy ignore list for pg-volume-backup.
#
# Temporary suppressions for CI builds that consume the published
# `1121citrus/aws-backup-base:latest` image before a refreshed base image is
# available in the registry. Local staging runs that build from the rebuilt
# local base are expected to be clean without these entries.
#
# Re-validate and remove these entries after the refreshed base image is
# published and downstream CI picks it up.

